  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">This bookwork describes the artist's walks through Paris to a variety of bakeries, what she might purchase at each, and her return to drink coffee and watch Paris through her window.  The five pop-up illustrations correspond to her journey and end with a small blue window.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The text is printed in silver ink and can be read across the six wedge-shaped sections.  The pop-up illustrations are between the sections.</subfield>
  </datafield>
